        "TileImage": "$($repository 15d519c6-a42c-42bd-8b32-5085a028c741).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47. Rico Delgado has issued a contract on the local shaman, Taita, as well as a group he&apos;s been working with in order to smuggle cocaine from the Delgado plantation. He would normally deal with this himself, but he fears killing the beloved shaman would result in the nearby town turning on him. The targets are quite far apart, but Rico wants this to be handled as quickly as possible. Sounds like a challenge... but this is you we&apos;re talking about, 47. I will leave you to prepare.",
